data: {"type":"tool-output-available","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-91a7c21250f2335f","output":{"output":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"dc7d24615afc5c4adc62dcc9110bdff7dcc7c7cf\",\"date\":\"2026-08-12T16:00:48+05:30\",\"message\":\"Document content package configuration in the README (#191)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Document content package configuration in the README\\n\\nReplace the Installation and Configuration sections with content package\\nsetup covering the globalproperties, billableservices, paymentmodes,\\ncashpoints and cashieritemprices Initializer domains.\\n\\nCorrect the requirements list: fhir2 and event are required modules, not\\noptional. Add the undocumented billing.currencySymbol property and fix the\\ndeclared default for billing.patientDashboard2BillCount.\\n\\n* Correct README inaccuracies and tidy the configuration section\\n\\n- Describe exemptions as concept-scoped JavaScript rules evaluated against\\n  the patient, age, order and active programs; there are no built-in\\n  location-based rules\\n- Note that timesheets are served at /rest/v2/billing/timesheet while the\\n  other resources are on v1\\n- Name the Initializer version that supports all four billing domains\\n- Point readers at omod/src/main/resources/config.xml for the property list\\n- Link the property tables to the receipt numbering and resolver sections\\n- Document the remaining causes of receipt sequence gaps and the per-JVM\\n  scope of reserved blocks\\n- Promote the content package subsections to h3\\n\\n* Document automatic order billing and how prices are resolved\\n\\n* Address review: REST namespace, exemption bindings, global property prefix, install deps\\n\\n* Address review: renew behaviour, CSV headers, strategy docs\\n\\nRenewing an order does not void the previous line item; only revise and\\ndiscontinue do.\\n\\nMove the file paths out of the CSV examples. Initializer reads the first\\nrow as the header, so the leading comment made the blocks uncopyable.\\n\\nSplit strategy customisation into adding a strategy for a new order type\\nand replacing a shipped one. Extending AbstractDefaultOrderBillingStrategy\\nrequires implementing resolveCashier and resolveCashPoint, which are\\ninherited returning null, and exemption checks live in createBillLineItem\\nrather than the shared pipeline.\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"15e5e4cf71392d4d2235191f24bd4a5a264f0dae\",\"date\":\"2026-06-02T12:37:02+05:30\",\"message\":\"Show discounts and refunds on bill receipts (#180)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Show discounts and refunds on bill receipts\\n\\n- Receipt now shows line-scoped discounts under each line item, plus Subtotal / Total Discount / Total in the totals block\\n  - New Refund section lists completed refunds with their reason\\n  - Due-amount math accounts for refunds\\n  - Fix NPE in Bill.synchronizeBillStatus() when payments is null\\n  - Add Liquibase 009b to drop orphaned payment_status column when both columns exist\\n\\n* Resolve Sonar issues\\n\\n* Resolve Sonar issues\\n\\n* Resolve Sonar issues\\n\\n* Use StringUtils.abbreviate\\n\\n* Drop trimming the refund reason\\n\\n* Fix due amount math\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"62a6f16b01904f153f1395b02a5c0dd4ae5e1f60\",\"date\":\"2026-05-28T15:12:21+05:30\",\"message\":\"Fix patient payment status returning PAID when no active bills exist (#182)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"d384c1afe4b4df95549694ecef78d855a98df743\",\"date\":\"2026-05-27T19:21:03+05:30\",\"message\":\"Fix orphaned payment_status column on cashier_bill_line_item (#181)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"On DBs where both payment_status and status ended up on cashier_bill_line_item after a partial migration, every line-item insert failed with Field 'payment_status' doesn't have a default value\\n\\n  - Tighten changeset 009 precondition so the rename only runs when status does not already exist\\n  - Add changeset 009b to backfill from payment_status and drop it when both columns exist\\n  - Pin <validCheckSum> on 009 so already-migrated DBs accept the precondition change\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"1dee616c219772026e79dddd7a80e57e6ea35c2d\",\"date\":\"2026-05-19T17:28:06+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5421: Associate bills with patient visits (#172)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (feat) Associate bills with patient visits\\n\\nAdds an optional visit association to Bill so bills can be linked to the\\nvisit they were generated during. The visit can be supplied explicitly\\nvia the REST API, is auto-populated from a patient's single active visit\\non create, and is auto-set from an order's encounter when a bill is\\ngenerated from orders. Bills can also be filtered by visitUuid.\\n\\n* Fix Patient mock failure on Java 21\\n\\nMockito's inline mock-maker cannot modify the full Patient class\\nhierarchy on Java 21. Use real Patient instances since the tests never\\nstub methods on them.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* (fix) Replace Order mocks with real instances for Java 21 compatibility\\n\\nMockito's inline mock-maker cannot instrument the full Order class\\nhierarchy on Java 21, causing TestOrderBillingStrategyTest to fail with\\n\\\"Mockito cannot mock this class: class org.openmrs.Order\\\". Use real\\nOrder/Encounter/Visit/Provider instances wired via setters instead.\\n\\nAlso fixes stale setPaymentStatus calls in BillServiceImplTest left over\\nfrom the BillLineItemStatus rename in e54193f.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* (fix) Replace CashPoint mock with real instance for Java 21 compatibility\\n\\nSame root cause as 4b75bc5: Mockito's inline mock-maker cannot\\ninstrument BaseOpenmrsMetadata's class hierarchy on Java 21.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* (fix) Replace BillLineItem mock with real instance for Java 21 compatibility\\n\\nLast remaining mock that fails under Java 21's inline mock-maker. With\\nthis, the visit-association tests use real instances throughout.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Validate bill visit association\\n\\n* Refactor bill resource save setup\\n\\n* Add bill visit index\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"49d6600c9d5a33b8bbac2b1c430c3c9725af0453\",\"date\":\"2026-05-19T16:41:39+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5410: Display Billing Payment Status Without Blocking Access to Clinical Forms (#173)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"f18f721e6da5184c98a600c70354414f1b0e0b8b\",\"date\":\"2026-05-14T16:50:24+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5417: Filter bills by discount status (#168)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Add discountStatus filter for bills\\n\\nFilter bills by non-voided line item discount status via EXISTS subquery\\nin BillSearch; parse discountStatus query param in BillResource and\\nvalidate against InvalidSearchException.\\n\\n* fix formatting issues\\n\\n* chore: address PR review comments\\n\\nMigrate BillResourceTest and BillLineItemResourceTest to JUnit Jupiter\\nto match the sibling PaymentResourceTest convention. Fix BillDiscount\\nimport order in HibernateBillDAO.\\n\\n* chore: use Locale.ROOT for status enum parsing\\n\\n* test: merge discount-status tests into existing HibernateBillDAOTest\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* chore: inline bill uuids to match existing test convention\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"b52412a0a7925469183c2590937d6720228f9ec6\",\"date\":\"2026-04-01T20:34:56+05:30\",\"message\":\"Payments should be associated with a cashier (#155)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* feat: add cashier (Provider) field to Payment model and HBM mapping\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* feat: add Liquibase migration for provider_id and error message key\\n\\n* feat: validate that new payments have an associated cashier\\n\\n* test: set cashier on payment in BillServiceImplTest\\n\\n* feat: auto-set cashier on payment from authenticated user; expose in REST representation\\n\\n* fix: run cashier validation before line-item DB query to avoid Hibernate auto-flush\\n\\nSwapped order so validateNewPaymentsHaveCashier runs before\\nvalidateLineItemsNotModified. The latter triggers a DB query that causes\\nHibernate to auto-flush transient payments, assigning them IDs and making\\nthe id==null check ineffective.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* Allow client to set cashier\\n\\n* Update liquibase\\n\\n* test: move validator tests to BillValidatorTest and add voided payment edge case\\n\\nRelocates payment-cashier and line-item validation tests from\\nBillServiceImplTest to BillValidatorTest so each test class covers its\\nown layer. Adds validate_shouldTolerateVoidedNewPaymentWithNoCashier to\\ncover the voided-payment branch in BillValidator.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* test: verify BillValidator cashier check is triggered via saveBill; require cashier in payment test\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* chore: address PR review comments\\n\\n- Delegate getCurrentCashier() to ProviderUtil.getCurrentProvider() to remove duplication\\n- Migrate PaymentResourceTest from JUnit4 to JUnit5\\n- Add trailing newline to liquibase.xml\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* chore: address PR review comments\\n\\n- Fix mixed tabs/spaces indentation in liquibase changeset\\n- Add null/blank UUID check in PaymentResource.setCashier\\n- Improve error message accuracy in BillResource\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n* chore: address PR review comments\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"7dfc3af97f42e94050d309742e38b580d3d8870e\",\"date\":\"2026-03-05T20:18:46+05:30\",\"message\":\"Revert \\\"O3-5197: Each payment should have an associated Cashier\\\" (#147)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"edd63790481fe565d8dbeb767a1ac8f29a1fb636\",\"date\":\"2026-03-04T11:07:07+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5197: Each payment should have an associated Cashier (#109)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"061d91a94954de7bae51aec04d7aec3af6198aa1\",\"date\":\"2026-01-28T17:41:08+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) Retrieve bill line item by UUID, fix fetch all cashpoints and payment modes (#91)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Cashpoints should not return with a 500\\n\\n* Add doGetAll to paymentmode and cashpoint\\n\\n* Update representation of cashpoint\\n\\n* fix update bill\\n\\n* review feedback\\n\\n* Make function read only transactional\\n\\n* Cashpoint should use usual wrapper to set reps\\n\\n* Review feedback\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"1adef07860790f1d3f989321f93a1db1aedce16c\",\"date\":\"2026-01-17T06:18:43+05:30\",\"message\":\"Migrate PaymentModeService to OpenMRS Service (#86)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* Migrate PaymentModeService to OpenMRS Service\\n\\n* Support getAll\\n\\n* Fix minor issues\\n\\n* update retirePaymentMode_shouldRetirePaymentMode test\\n\\n* Add includeAll support\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"e1153d7b5cd307bdeb9d0a874c3ef8d282c7ed0a\",\"date\":\"2025-12-03T18:52:25+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5246: Fixing the payments issue Post addition of Pending state check (#72)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"4a26b524d8a68ed3f0c4068a5a6a3d843cc6aba2\",\"date\":\"2025-11-18T19:07:13+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5215: Enable Custom Representation for BillLineItemResource and PaymentResource (#62)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Wikum Weerakutti\",\"authorEmail\":\"wikum@linuxdeveloper.space\"},{\"hash\":\"32ccfa894bb915591d1e9ac4ab0814c725103805\",\"date\":\"2025-11-18T01:24:42+05:30\",\"message\":\"O3-5178: Exclude voided payments from bill status calculation (#48)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Raj Prakash\",\"authorEmail\":\"raj.24bcs10328@sst.scaler.com\"},{\"hash\":\"33da824e58d815ca3a4330e6e6176a881a6cf00d\",\"date\":\"2025-11-11T18:55:00+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5122: Bill should not return voided line items (#46)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix): Bill should not return voided line items\\n\\n* Remove voided line items and payments from service level\\n\\n* filter voided line items in get bill by receipt number\\n\\n* Add filtering logic to the existing null remover function\\n\\n* Add transaction annotation to implementation\\n\\n* Review feedback\\n\\n* rename include voided items param to include all\\n\\n* Review feedback\\n\\n* Review feedback\",\"authorName\":\"Nethmi Rodrigo\",\"authorEmail\":\"nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"82744fc6144583f90605e42b1bf6ddf490b87fdb\",\"date\":\"2025-10-07T14:15:05+03:00\",\"message\":\"(docs) Update README to reflect comprehensive billing functionality (#29)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (docs) Update README to reflect comprehensive billing functionality\\n\\nUpdates the content of the README to reflect the actual functionality of the module. Changes include:\\n\\n- Change module name from \\\"Cashier Module\\\" to \\\"OpenMRS Billing Module\\\"\\n- Expand feature descriptions to cover all capabilities (bill management,\\n  payment processing, receipts, cash points, timesheets, exemptions, reports)\\n- Add missing global properties (rounding, adjustment, reports configuration)\\n- Add REST API endpoints documentation\\n- Include Java version requirement (1.8+)\\n- Condense format for better readability\\n- Update documentation links and support channels\\n\\n* Add OpenHMIS attribution\\n\\n* Update required IDGen module version\\n\\n* More review feedback\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"a97416d3f8a29cde8cb5058b51dda6d6d1fd4849\",\"date\":\"2024-08-28T10:23:54+03:00\",\"message\":\"(Enhancement) Correctly handle bill status and payment transactions (#12)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"AJAL ODORA JONATHAN\",\"authorEmail\":\"43242517+ODORA0@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"14df3df01ed49a12084f575978628a06eb0969c5\",\"date\":\"2023-12-18T21:42:42+03:00\",\"message\":\"Link item prices to payment modes\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"jecihjoy\",\"authorEmail\":\"jecihjoy@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"83e6bc01b317cfe539393efeb706e8786a47176e\",\"date\":\"2023-12-11T17:10:21+03:00\",\"message\":\"Fix issues with payment sub resource\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"jecihjoy\",\"authorEmail\":\"jecihjoy@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"3464f7ebe039cbd885d53475d6c24372b67c725d\",\"date\":\"2023-11-29T12:36:09+03:00\",\"message\":\"track payment status for bill line item\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"ojwanganto\",\"authorEmail\":\"ojwangantony.g7kenya@gmail.com\"}],\"totalCount\":21}"}}

