data: {"type":"data-evidence","data":{"id":1,"productId":"openmrs","generation":"g-ab363e","repository":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-module-billing","path":"README.md","revision":"HEAD","startLine":20,"code":["","Resolve a patient's overall payment status (paid / pending / exempted / no active bills) via a pluggable resolver, configurable through the `billing.patientPaymentStatusResolver` global property. Designed to surface payment state without blocking access to clinical forms.","","### Payment Processing","","Process payments using multiple payment modes (cash, insurance, mobile money, credit/debit cards, custom modes) with support for partial payments, payment attributes, automatic change calculation, and per-payment cashier attribution.","","### Receipt Generation",""],"highlightedLines":[23,24,25]}}

